{"id":"audience","lemma":"audience","pos":"noun","rank":1917,"glosses":["audience, viewer","hearing"],"ipa":"/o.djɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b9/Fr-audience.ogg/Fr-audience.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"audiences"},"formAudio":{"audiences":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-audiences.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La salle d'audience était bondée.","en":"The courtroom was packed.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room, hall"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"crowded, packed","l":"bondé"}]},{"text":"L'audience fut profondément affectée.","en":"The audience was deeply affected.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/27786","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"deeply, profoundly"},null]},{"text":"Quand le juge parle, toute la salle d'audience l'écoute.","en":"When the judge speaks, everyone in the courtroom listens.","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"judge"},{"g":"to speak, talk","l":"parler"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room, hall"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to listen","l":"écouter"}]},{"text":"Tom marchait dans la salle d'audience.","en":"Tom walked into the courtroom.","words":[null,{"g":"to walk","l":"marcher"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room, hall"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"L'ambiance dans la salle d'audience était tendue.","en":"The mood in the courtroom was tense.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"ambiance"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room, hall"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"tight","l":"tendu"}]}]}